==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. This stage consist of all Red enemies, so make sure you equip some [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]].

